============================================================
fixes my HLS streams from Telemach
it fixes realtime thing

"false" - faster channel switch time
"true"  - slower channel switch time

Can be set directly when reading M3U8 if always set to false.

Or
#EXT-X-PLAYLIST-TYPE:VOD

============================================================
little speed up of channel switch

don't send two GET requests for m3u8 list

Or add
    #KODIPROP:mimetype=application/vnd.apple.mpegurl
before every channel
============================================================

  https://github.com/xbmc/xbmc/pull/14193
  VideoPlayer: fix/improve audio stalls of realtime streams #14193


diff -aurNp a/src/iptvsimple/PlaylistLoader.cpp b/src/iptvsimple/PlaylistLoader.cpp
--- a/src/iptvsimple/PlaylistLoader.cpp	2020-06-15 18:29:48.000000000 +0200
+++ b/src/iptvsimple/PlaylistLoader.cpp	2020-06-29 17:17:29.668894392 +0200
@@ -140,8 +140,9 @@ bool PlaylistLoader::LoadPlayList()
     {
       Logger::Log(LEVEL_DEBUG, "%s - Adding channel '%s' with URL: '%s'", __FUNCTION__, tmpChannel.GetChannelName().c_str(), line.c_str());
 
-      if (isRealTime)
-        tmpChannel.AddProperty(PVR_STREAM_PROPERTY_ISREALTIMESTREAM, "true");
+      // for all my channels
+      (void) isRealTime;
+      tmpChannel.AddProperty(PVR_STREAM_PROPERTY_ISREALTIMESTREAM, "false");
 
       Channel channel(tmpChannel);
       channel.SetStreamURL(line);
